  "title": "Futu Announces Cumulative Repurchases of Approximately US$290 Million Worth of ADSs Under Share Repurchase Program",
  "summary": "HONG KONG, May 27, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Futu Holdings Limited (\"Futu\" or the \"Company\") (Nasdaq: Futu), today announced that as of this announcement, the cumulative repurchases under its share repurchase program have reached approximately US$290 million worth of its American depositary shares",
